; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: each group of postings, the real
; ones and the balanced virtual ones in [brackets], may have one posting
; without an amount.  A transaction can therefore have two such postings,
; so when the balanced virtual postings have a second one, the error says
; which group it is in.

2020-01-01 Groceries
    Expenses:Food                     $10.00
    Assets:Cash
    [Budget:Food]
    [Budget:Unallocated]

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 11:
Error: Only one balanced virtual posting with null amount allowed per transaction
end test
